# NOTE (2026-09-15 security remediation): memory.md, CHANGELOG.md, and
# CLAUDE.md used to be excluded here. Git is the only sync mechanism across
# RoniKid's multiple accounts/machines, so ignoring these meant one account
# could log "fixed" in CHANGELOG.md while another account's copy never learned
# the fix existed — that desync is the root cause the Sept 2026 security audit
# (SM-01) traced three "documented as fixed" regressions back to. The repo is
# private, so there's no public-facing confidentiality reason to exclude them.
# They are now tracked. If you add a genuinely personal note that shouldn't
# sync, put it in a new untracked file rather than re-adding these three.
#
# THEME_OVERHAUL.md is left ignored — it's a one-off planning scratchpad, not
# a state-of-truth doc other sessions rely on for correctness.
THEME_OVERHAUL.md

# Local launcher — machine-specific
Studymind.bat
